{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Buckle Up! Demo</strong> is a 2\u20136 player online party shooter where quick matches and unpredictable moments keep everyone on their toes. Jump into fast-paced rounds with friends or strangers, switch up your strategy on the fly, and try not to fall off the train.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the demo version of the game, you\u2019ll have access to the first 3 maps, 4 gamemodes, and a few basic cosmetics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each match brings a new challenge, with different gamemodes, weapons to upgrade, and plenty of ways to mess with your opponents. Win by scoring points, outplaying your rivals, or just staying on board a little longer than everyone else.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750850/extras/Title1.png?t=1748292475\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750850/extras/NewMultiplayerGif1.gif?t=1748292475\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Jump into the chaos with up to 6 players in online multiplayer. Play with friends or find new rivals in public lobbies.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750850/extras/Title2.png?t=1748292475\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750850/extras/NewGamemodesGif.gif?t=1748292475\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you're stealing flags, holding hills, dodging players with bombs, or just going full deathmatch, there's always a new way to win or lose!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750850/extras/Title3.png?t=1748292475\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750850/extras/GunScreenGIf.gif?t=1748292475\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect upgrades for your weapons mid-match. Adapt on the fly with special weapons and game-changing pickups then unleash chaos on your competition.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750850/extras/Title4.png?t=1748292475\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750850/extras/NewCompeteGif.gif?t=1748292475\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Outplay your friends, grab the high score, and fight for the top spot.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750850/extras/Title5.png?t=1748292475\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750850/extras/CosmeticsGIf.gif?t=1748292475\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Show off your personality with customizable outfits and characters. From stylish to downright ridiculous.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Online multiplayer for 2\u20136 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique gamemodes <i>(4 available in demo)</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In-match weapon upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fast rounds with dynamic objectives</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Character customization with unlockables <i>(limited selection in demo)</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fun, reactive, and interactable environments <i>(3 maps in demo)</i></p></li></ul></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3750850?t=1748292475","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3750850?t=1748292475","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750850/4d3e8f9d18fa9c762a2d4482d01f0d8d3932d49e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748292475","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750850/4d3e8f9d18fa9c762a2d4482d01f0d8d3932d49e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748292475","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Buckle Up! Demo</strong> is a 2\u20136 player online party shooter where quick matches and unpredictable moments keep everyone on their toes. Jump into fast-paced rounds with friends or strangers, switch up your strategy on the fly, and try not to fall off the train.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In the demo version of the game, you\u2019ll have access to the first 3 maps, 4 gamemodes, and a few basic cosmetics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each match brings a new challenge, with different gamemodes, weapons to upgrade, and plenty of ways to mess with your opponents. Win by scoring points, outplaying your rivals, or just staying on board a little longer than everyone else.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750850/extras/Title1.png?