aragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Outplay your friends, grab the high score, and fight for the top spot.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750850/extras/Title5.png?t=1748292475\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750850/extras/CosmeticsGIf.gif?t=1748292475\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Show off your personality with customizable outfits and characters. From stylish to downright ridiculous.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Key Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Online multiplayer for 2\u20136 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique gamemodes <i>(4 available in demo)</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In-match weapon upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fast rounds with dynamic objectives</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Character customization with unlockables <i>(limited selection in demo)</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fun, reactive, and interactable environments <i>(3 maps in demo)</i></p></li></ul></li></ul>","developers":["Chunky Pixel Games"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3620720","name":"Buckle Up!"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3750850/e463912783b118a7071ea86f8918fdd94fea7c4b/header.jpg?t=1748292475","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257145950,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257145950/movie480.mp4?t=1748292473","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257145950/movie_max.mp4?t=1748292473"},"name":"Demo Trail